the fourth coordinate of the residue divisor, the prime data at `13` and `37` (`m₁₃ = 3`,
`m₃₇ = 2`, test at `pairMult = 1`) and the failed principality test; `emitNonElem` printed this
file. The certificates are checked below by the kernel (the branches above infinity one root at a
time), and **`not_elementary`** follows from `not_elementary_of_torsOKP` through the base change
`ℚ → ℚ(ζ₁₂) → Kc`.
-/

